    },
    "source": {
      "value": "pc1"
    },
    "description": {
      "value": "You called the wilderness home as you found trails and guided travelers. Your wanderlust could have called you to the adventuring life, or perhaps you served as a scout for soldiers and found you liked battle.\n\nChoose two attribute boosts. One must be to Dexterity or Wisdom, and one is a free attribute boost.\n\nYou're trained in the Survival skill and a Lore skill related to one terrain you scouted in (such as Forest Lore or Cavern Lore). You gain the Forager skill feat."
    },
